WEBVTT

00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:06.880
Bloody Rain!

00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:14.430
Now, go on ahead!

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:16.430
Right! Thanks!

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:21.440
Those who were swallowed up should be
locked up at the very bottom of Eden.

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:22.840
Got it!

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:32.780
Ahh! There's more!

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:35.780
Tearju! Can't you do something
about these monsters!?

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:40.150
They are probably the life energy
of the people swallowed,

00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:42.790
transformed by nanomachines.

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:45.460
They will appear anywhere
within Eden's power!

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:47.800
I don't need lectures! Just do something!

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:50.900
If you head towards the rear
and go to the control room from its back,

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:52.470
there are fewer defenses!

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:54.630
Gotcha!

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:16.420
<i>That's how it always starts...</i>
<i>under the azure sky</i>

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:23.330
<i>After making a vow,</i>
<i>I now set off</i>

00:01:36.210 --> 00:01:42.720
<i>Yeah, the desert glitters with a golden hue</i>
<i>(The wind is scorching)</i>

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:49.060
<i>I'm searching for a diamond flower</i>
<i>(I keep on wandering)</i>

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:55.400
<i>Now, for the first time in my life,</i>

00:01:55.400 --> 00:02:01.740
<i>I live for someone else</i>

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:08.240
<i>There's something</i>
<i>I wanna protect</i>

00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:14.250
<i>I'll never,</i>
<i>ever lose it again</i>

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:17.750
<i>Resound,</i>
<i>my heartbeat!</i>

00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:27.750
<i>A heartbeat smaller and fragile,</i>
<i>but tougher than anyone's.</i>

00:02:53.450 --> 00:02:56.620
Live the way you want.

00:02:58.790 --> 00:03:02.060
Freedom, huh?

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:04.550
Hey, didja say something!?

00:03:08.570 --> 00:03:12.170
"Carefree Cat"

00:03:20.410 --> 00:03:23.410
Bro, I believe in you!

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:34.430
Sorry, but you can't go any further!

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:37.100
Take this! Penetrating Curse!

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:39.430
Leave him to me!

00:03:39.430 --> 00:03:41.830
Thanks! I'm going ahead!

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:54.240
No one can stop Eden's progress!

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:02.050
Wh- what the!?

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:05.060
Now let us go, Eve.

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:07.820
Not to that fake castle...

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:13.590
But to an even more fun castle...

00:04:16.070 --> 00:04:18.070
Even more fun?

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:21.070
There will be lots of friends there.

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:22.970
You want to go, don't you?

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:29.850
Eve!!

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:34.580
What's the matter?

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:38.050
Come, this way.

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:03.380
Train!? Sven!?

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:04.380
What's wrong?

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:06.720
I've lost communication with them...

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:09.050
Wh- what does that mean!?

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:12.780
Something's strange!

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:17.060
Wow!

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:18.730
Amazing!

00:05:18.730 --> 00:05:21.100
It's so shiny!

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:32.070
Leon!

00:05:46.430 --> 00:05:47.760
Welcome!

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:49.430
--Welcome!
--Welcome!
--Welcome!

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:50.760
What would you like to order?

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:53.770
--What would you like to order?
--What would you like to order?
--What would you like to order?

00:05:53.770 --> 00:05:56.100
Layla looks so happy...

00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:57.100
Yeah...

00:05:57.100 --> 00:06:01.040
Running a bread shop was her dream.

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:04.040
I'm definitely gonna protect this shop!

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:06.380
Hah! I can handle that all alone!

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:10.380
What!? I'll protect the shop
and Layla by myself!

00:06:10.380 --> 00:06:12.380
I will too!

00:06:12.380 --> 00:06:17.390
I will, too! I won't let you
lay a finger on my friends!

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:19.090
Leon!

00:06:20.390 --> 00:06:23.730
You certainly seem
to have gotten stronger.

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:25.730
Haven't you realized it yet?

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:28.730
The formidable power we possess...

00:06:28.730 --> 00:06:31.740
Your time has ended.

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:34.070
You sure underestimate us.

00:06:34.070 --> 00:06:36.410
We will definitely not lose!

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:39.470
There is only death for traitors.

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:43.610
Now feel the blade of justice!

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:54.430
It's gotten awfully quiet.

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:57.100
Now what will we do, Sephiria?

00:06:57.100 --> 00:06:59.430
It is obvious.

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:01.030
Are you sure?

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:03.140
Isn't it the case that, at heart,

00:07:03.140 --> 00:07:06.070
you wish to live freely
like Black Cat, too?

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:15.780
I shall walk the path I believe in!

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:25.720
Are you sure you wanna get off here?

00:07:25.720 --> 00:07:28.060
There's quite a ways to town.

00:07:28.060 --> 00:07:30.730
Sure, it's not too far that I can't walk.

00:07:30.730 --> 00:07:35.070
Oh yeah... if you see that guy...
let me know.

00:07:35.070 --> 00:07:36.970
Sure, I will.

00:07:40.410 --> 00:07:43.410
I wonder where he went...

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:47.440
No one saw him after the battle with Eden.

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:53.440
Hah! Who cares where that guy went!?

00:07:57.760 --> 00:08:01.090
Sonic Fist!

00:08:04.030 --> 00:08:08.060
Until we destroy Eden, we'll never die!

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:14.040
What the!?

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:15.370
N- no way!

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:16.710
Damn!

00:08:16.710 --> 00:08:17.970
Hey!

00:08:41.730 --> 00:08:43.790
Damn it!

00:08:52.410 --> 00:08:54.750
Eden is starting to move again!

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:56.080
Where is everyone?

00:08:56.080 --> 00:09:00.690
I've... lost communication
with all of them...

00:09:00.690 --> 00:09:02.350
No!

00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:19.370
Oh, it's going away!

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:21.840
Please come back!

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:34.720
Everyone, stop resisting...

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:39.090
and give yourself to Eden's rain...

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:49.740
Oh, what's the matter?
Why are you crying?

00:09:49.740 --> 00:09:54.070
That's not good. You are not human.

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:57.170
You are merely a machine part of Eden!

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:04.420
Now then...

00:10:04.420 --> 00:10:06.550
it is time to remove the barrier

00:10:06.550 --> 00:10:08.090
that separates people's
physical and spiritual self,

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:14.030
and enjoy eternal sleep as one living being.

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:19.430
A little more... just a little bit more...

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:24.770
My program has entered its final stage!

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:26.240
Connections reestablished!

00:10:29.110 --> 00:10:30.440
Sorry...

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:35.210
Your program will never reach completion!

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:41.010
Well, well... I welcome you, Black Cat.

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:45.790
You were still alive.
Very stubborn, aren't you?

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:51.920
Oh well... how about it?
A game of nine-ball?

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:58.800
Oh dear...

00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:03.410
Doctor Kanzaki, release Eve immediately!

00:11:03.410 --> 00:11:08.080
You know, you shouldn't hack into
other people's systems, Dr. Lunatique.

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:12.580
Oh? And that coming
from the man who stole my data

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:15.420
and sold his soul to the devil!?

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:17.760
Now that's pretty harsh thing to say...

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:22.760
But that's all right. Eden has
arrived in Palmila City after all.

00:11:22.760 --> 00:11:27.770
Even if a lone Black Cat infiltrated,
what can he do?

00:11:27.770 --> 00:11:29.960
What if it's more than one?

00:11:33.770 --> 00:11:36.500
You shouldn't take us lightly.

00:11:39.110 --> 00:11:41.110
Why you!

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:44.450
Well, sorry, but we're here
to take Eve back.

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:47.120
What can a bunch like you do!?

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:50.120
And what can you do, all by yourself?

00:11:50.120 --> 00:11:52.650
And what if he's not alone?

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:56.260
Why you!

00:11:58.460 --> 00:12:00.990
I thought we gave them fatal wounds!

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:10.410
We cannot be killed inside Eden!

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:11.740
Nanomachines!

00:12:11.740 --> 00:12:16.410
Tsk! I don't know what's going on,
but there are more of us than you guys!

00:12:16.410 --> 00:12:19.750
There's plenty of us
to handle the lot of you!

00:12:19.750 --> 00:12:22.420
Train! Sven! Hurry! Get Eve!

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:24.090
We're running out of time!

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:26.090
Eve is on the top floor of that tower!

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:28.090
It's over there!

00:12:28.090 --> 00:12:29.760
Now this is interesting!

00:12:29.760 --> 00:12:33.430
If you think you can
destroy my perfect program...

00:12:33.430 --> 00:12:36.430
Just try it!

00:12:36.430 --> 00:12:38.100
Awright, leave this...

00:12:38.100 --> 00:12:39.440
...to us!

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:40.770
You two...

00:12:40.770 --> 00:12:42.770
Please go to Eve!

00:12:42.770 --> 00:12:44.780
I'm coming with you, Kuro-<i>sama</i>!

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:46.440
You will stay here, too.

00:12:46.440 --> 00:12:47.450
Boooo!

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:49.450
We are already one with Eden!

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:53.120
As long as Eden exists, we will not die!

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:54.290
And no matter how many times you revive,

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:55.790
we shall just destroy you
over and over again!

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:57.790
Go! Go for it, Mister!

00:12:57.790 --> 00:12:59.120
Beat them up!

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:02.730
Jenos! Don't you dare lose!

00:13:02.730 --> 00:13:04.630
I'm counting on you to get Eve!

00:13:32.420 --> 00:13:35.090
That power... is it Tao?

00:13:35.090 --> 00:13:36.090
Precisely...

00:13:36.090 --> 00:13:43.430
It is the ultimate technique that I learned
from a Taoist twenty years ago.

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:51.210
The Itairiku War... It was so horrible,
gruesome and tragic

00:13:51.210 --> 00:13:54.040
that it seemed as if
it was out of this world.

00:13:55.110 --> 00:13:57.620
And that is when I thought...

00:13:57.620 --> 00:14:04.720
to end this despicable history
of man's hatred and cruelty.

00:14:04.720 --> 00:14:08.130
When the war ended
and I returned to Chronos,

00:14:08.130 --> 00:14:10.400
I quietly enlisted comrades.

00:14:10.400 --> 00:14:15.070
Taoist survivors and a scientist...

00:14:15.070 --> 00:14:16.930
And...

00:14:19.740 --> 00:14:22.410
erasers...

00:14:22.410 --> 00:14:26.310
In other words...
the Apostles of the Stars...

00:14:27.750 --> 00:14:30.080
Creed!

00:14:30.080 --> 00:14:33.080
Humph! What are you doing here?

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:36.760
Train, I will destroy this man!

00:14:36.760 --> 00:14:39.420
You can go to Eve.

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:40.760
You!

00:14:40.760 --> 00:14:43.090
Hurry and go, Train!

00:14:43.090 --> 00:14:44.430
How funny...

00:14:44.430 --> 00:14:49.330
A failure... who has become
a mere mortal is going to beat me!?

00:14:50.440 --> 00:14:53.770
You left him for dead...
and now call him a failure?

00:14:53.770 --> 00:14:56.780
Is that what you call noble!?

00:14:56.780 --> 00:14:59.110
Killing ten thousand people at Bioberg...

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:01.380
Destroying Torneo's research facility...

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:03.380
Those are all your doing!?

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:08.050
I could not afford to let anyone
find out about the Project.

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:11.720
And in order to teach Eve about human life,

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:14.850
you just let us take her away, huh!?

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:19.400
You were a fine father to Eve.

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:24.070
And now, you must let go...
as a good father-of-the-bride would.

00:15:24.070 --> 00:15:25.400
Bride?

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:29.070
Eve was created for Adam from the start.

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:34.750
Although Adam is just a program
to make Eden work.

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:36.210
What!?

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:48.390
Eve!!

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:54.770
Train! Where are you!? Train!

00:15:54.770 --> 00:15:57.440
This is no time to play hide-and-seek!

00:15:57.440 --> 00:15:59.500
Come on out, Train!

00:16:02.710 --> 00:16:05.710
Why... are you here?

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:08.380
I thought you were dead!

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:11.050
Zagine!

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:15.050
What's the matter? Is that gun
just for decoration?

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:16.720
Shoot!

00:16:16.720 --> 00:16:19.450
This is your chance to
avenge your parents' deaths.

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:26.730
Eve!! Where are you!?

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:30.740
A flower!? That's the receptor!
I'm sure of it!

00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:33.740
Eve should be there
in the center of that flower!

00:16:33.740 --> 00:16:36.000
Where!? Where!?

00:16:38.740 --> 00:16:40.110
Eve!

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:47.420
Eve!

00:16:47.420 --> 00:16:50.290
Eve!!

00:16:52.090 --> 00:16:54.090
Why hesitate!?

00:16:54.090 --> 00:16:57.650
Let's hurry and... settle this!

00:16:59.760 --> 00:17:04.370
I... came here to save my friend!

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:08.530
I don't have time to fight you!

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:14.050
You're as cowardly as ever!

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:17.040
If you won't shoot, I will go first.

00:17:21.050 --> 00:17:25.010
Oh, looks like you're finally serious...

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:30.400
Hah! You hold a gun,
but don't intend to shoot, huh?

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:31.490
Fool!

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:57.290
Live or die...

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:02.090
I'll let you choose.

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:06.030
What's the matter?

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:09.230
If you pull the trigger, you might live.

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:14.710
You're not Zagine.

00:18:14.710 --> 00:18:17.710
It's a trick by this monstrosity Eden...

00:18:17.710 --> 00:18:22.200
The ghost inside my mind
just materialized, is all!

00:18:24.050 --> 00:18:27.050
Humph, who cares?

00:18:27.050 --> 00:18:32.220
The important thing right now is
if you pull the trigger, you can live.

00:18:34.390 --> 00:18:36.060
Listen...

00:18:36.060 --> 00:18:39.730
Those who choose guns
will live in solitude for life.

00:18:39.730 --> 00:18:42.730
Everyone else is
either enemy or prey.

00:18:42.730 --> 00:18:46.070
Those such as the friends
that you are trying to protect

00:18:46.070 --> 00:18:49.070
are just weaklings comforting each other.

00:18:49.070 --> 00:18:53.370
Hah! Weaklings comforting
each other, huh?

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:57.310
--Damn!
--We're surrounded!

00:18:58.750 --> 00:19:00.450
Belze!

00:19:02.350 --> 00:19:03.690
Echidna!

00:19:03.690 --> 00:19:08.360
I'm the only one who can protect you, so...

00:19:08.360 --> 00:19:10.590
Why you!!

00:19:12.030 --> 00:19:14.370
Eve!!

00:19:14.370 --> 00:19:17.700
Dammit! I can't reach her!

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:19.370
What'll I do!?

00:19:19.370 --> 00:19:24.040
Break the stem of the flower! Then Eve
will be released from the receptor!

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:26.040
H- how?

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:30.050
Dammit, where's Train when I need him!?

00:19:30.050 --> 00:19:34.390
Hey Train! Do something!

00:19:34.390 --> 00:19:38.080
You don't understand a thing, Zagine.

00:19:39.390 --> 00:19:42.390
Train! I'll treat you to milk!

00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:45.450
That's what makes it interesting!

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:21.100
Regarding those who were rescued

00:20:21.100 --> 00:20:23.430
from the huge mysterious flying object
that went down...

00:20:23.430 --> 00:20:29.070
It has just been confirmed that
all are alive! Repeat, they are all alive!

00:20:33.780 --> 00:20:37.010
Are you sure that it's okay, Eve?

00:20:43.120 --> 00:20:47.420
--Uh-huh...
--She was nice to suggest
that you live with her.

00:20:50.460 --> 00:20:52.460
Hello?

00:20:52.460 --> 00:20:54.130
Oh, it's you.

00:20:54.130 --> 00:20:56.530
Are things going well with Jenos?

00:20:57.800 --> 00:20:59.930
You don't have to hide it.

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:04.680
What? You saw Train?

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:09.080
No... it's okay.

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:10.810
Thanks for letting me know.

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:16.920
Aren't you going to look for Train?

00:21:18.090 --> 00:21:19.680
Nah.

00:21:21.090 --> 00:21:24.430
Thanks, the milk was delicious.

00:21:24.430 --> 00:21:26.230
See you around!

00:21:28.770 --> 00:21:32.100
I didn't get to thank Train.

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:35.160
For saving me.

00:21:37.780 --> 00:21:42.450
Not to worry...
He'll suddenly show up before long.

00:21:42.450 --> 00:21:47.040
After all, he's a carefree stray cat.

00:21:52.460 --> 00:21:56.790
Being free is nice, after all.

00:21:56.790 --> 00:21:57.800
Say something?

00:21:57.800 --> 00:21:59.460
Uh-uh...

00:22:14.410 --> 00:22:21.420
<i>Since your new black boots</i>
<i>caused a blister,</i>

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:28.420
<i>you rest your right foot</i>

00:22:28.420 --> 00:22:38.420
<i>We'll keep walking along</i>
<i>with our own rhythm, without rushing</i>

00:22:41.940 --> 00:22:51.940
<i>Don't say anything</i>
<i>because we'll soon understand each other</i>

00:22:56.490 --> 00:23:06.490
<i>I'm just holding you now to keep you warm</i>

00:23:10.730 --> 00:23:20.730
<i>I'm completely wrapped around you, so...</i>

00:23:21.140 --> 00:23:31.140
<i>Quietly the powder-like snow</i>
<i>is building up...</i>
